WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Organizations that spend federal grant money face a Single Audit. One wrong total, and the auditor finds it first.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Grant Audit Ready checks your package before the auditor does. Upload your awards schedule, statements and last year's findings. Scanned PDFs work too.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The AI only reads and quotes. Plain code does the math and applies the rules. If a finding cannot point to the exact page it came from, we drop it.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Every report shows what it cost. In our recorded run, 120 synthetic packages cost about six cents. And we show what we miss: award numbers, nine of eighteen.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Grant Audit Ready, by AIZOYA. Built on Meta Muse Ember. Try it now.
